  "description": "MIT licensed, AutoMapper-compatible object mapper for .NET 8/9/10. Same API names (Profile, CreateMap, ForMember, MapFrom, IMapper, MapperConfiguration, ProjectTo, AssertConfigurationIsValid) so existing AutoMapper code migrates by changing the package and using statements. Hybrid engine: compile-time Source Generator plus cached Expression Tree compilation, EF Core ProjectTo, fail-fast validation and mapping plan diagnostics.",
  "id": "VeloxMapper",
