  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.1.0: IMapperBase and IRuntimeMapper interfaces (AutoMapper parity); object to Dictionary/ExpandoObject mapping and ExpandoObject sources; default Get prefix on source properties; null reference to Nullable<T> stays null; IncludeMembers reversed by ReverseMap; nested context.Mapper.Map calls inherit Items/State/service factory/reference cache; scoped-provider mappers no longer pooled; migration script hardened (Razor files, aliases, fully-qualified exceptions, PrivateAssets refs, DI-only projects, string/comment masking, encoding safety, read-only files); deterministic build without local paths. See https://veloxmapper-website.netlify.app/docs/changelog",
